+- VERIFICATION: Five focused fake-only Swift suites passed 51 tests, including `hostPolicy -> credentialLookup -> authentication` ordering, first use/match/change/rotation/revocation/malformed decisions, snapshot validation, bootstrap golden mapping, diagnostics redaction, and zero-resource repeated cleanup. Three additional cleanup/redaction matrix repetitions passed; captured-log prohibited-data and test-source live-Security scans returned no matches. A coverage run reported 87.29% affected lines and 85.43% affected functions; strict Swift format, core boundaries, and diff checks exited 0. No real Keychain, SSH connection, NetworkExtension runtime, VPN configuration, route, DNS, interface, or packet-filter operation ran.
