+
+## Privacy and safety scans
+
+- Captured-log scan searched synthetic hostname, full address, credential reference, key, passphrase, and prohibited-field sentinels. `rg` exited 1, meaning no matches.
+- The Keychain test-source scan searched `SecKeychainCopyDomainDefault`, `SecKeychainCreate`, `SecKeychainDelete`, `SecItemAdd`, and `SecItemCopyMatching`. `rg` exited 1, meaning no live Security API remains in the suite.
+- The replaced test previously created and queried throwaway Keychains; this anomaly and the fake-only correction are recorded in `LOGBOOK.md`.
+- No SSH connection, external host contact, NetworkExtension provider launch/install/signing, VPN preference/configuration, route, DNS, interface, or packet-filter mutation ran.
